{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Gemini Explicit Context Caching (cachedContents)",
    "description": "Create a cache once for a reusable long prefix (documents, system instructions, or tool definitions). Subsequent generation requests send only the cache name and a new question; cached tokens are billed at the cache hit rate. The interface follows the Gemini native cachedContents format.",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://direct.evolink.ai",
      "description": "Production (recommended)"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "Fallback endpoint"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Explicit Context Caching",
      "description": "Create, retrieve, extend, and delete Gemini explicit caches"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1beta/cachedContents": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Create a cache",
        "operationId": "geminiCreateCachedContent",
        "tags": [
          "Explicit Context Caching"
        ],
        "description": "Create a cache from at least one of `contents`, `systemInstruction`, or `tools`, optionally with `toolConfig`, and receive its `name`.\n\n- **Models**: `model` accepts either `models/gemini-3.8-flash` or `gemini-3.8-flash`. Supported models: `gemini-3.8-flash`, `gemini-3.7-flash`, `gemini-3.6-flash`, `gemini-3.5-flash`, `gemini-3.5-flash-lite`, `gemini-3-flash-preview`, `gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview`, `gemini-3.1-pro-preview`, `gemini-3.1-pro-preview-customtools`, and `gemini-3-pro-preview`. Gemini 4 models do not support explicit caching.\n- **Lifetime**: Provide either `ttl`, such as `\"3600s\"`, or `expireTime` (RFC 3339), but not both. Defaults to 1 hour when neither is provided. Minimum 60 seconds, maximum 168 hours (`604800s`); deleted automatically on expiry.\n- **Size**: The request body must not exceed 10 MB. Content must meet the model's minimum cache token count (for example, 4,096 tokens for `gemini-3.8-flash`); otherwise, returns 400.\n- **Fields**: Only the documented fields are accepted; other fields return 400.\n- **tools**: Only `googleSearch`, `codeExecution`, and `functionDeclarations` are accepted; other tools return 400.\n- **Returned `name`**: Has the form `cachedContents/<id>`, where `<id>` is this request's ID. Search for it on the dashboard's Logs page to find the cache creation charge.\n- **Billing**: Creation charges a cache write fee (at the input rate) and the storage fee (per million tokens per hour) for the full lifetime upfront. When a cache is referenced, cached tokens are billed at the cache hit rate; if the cache declares `googleSearch`, each search is billed separately. Shortening, deleting, or expiry does not refund storage fees; extensions charge for the added duration. See [Pricing](https://evolink.ai/pricing) for per-model rates.\n\nAuthenticate with `Authorization: Bearer`; the `x-goog-api-key` header is also accepted.",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateCachedContentRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "long_document": {
                  "summary": "Cache a long document and system instructions for 1 hour",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "models/gemini-3.8-flash",
                    "displayName": "product-manual-v3",
                    "systemInstruction": {
                      "parts": [
                        {
                          "text": "You are a product manual assistant. Answer only from the provided manual. If information is absent, say \"Not mentioned in the manual\"."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "contents": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "parts": [
                          {
                            "text": "(Insert the full product manual here. Cached content must contain at least 4,096 tokens.)"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "ttl": "3600s"
                  }
                },
                "with_tools": {
                  "summary": "Cache system instructions and function definitions with an absolute expiry time",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "gemini-3.8-flash",
                    "displayName": "support-agent-tools",
                    "systemInstruction": {
                      "parts": [
                        {
                          "text": "(Insert lengthy customer support guidelines here, containing at least 4,096 tokens.)"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "contents": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "parts": [
                          {
                            "text": "(Examples of past support tickets...)"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "functionDeclarations": [
                          {
                            "name": "lookup_order",
                            "description": "Look up order status by order number",
                            "parameters": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "order_id": {
                                  "type": "string"
                                }
                              },
                              "required": [
                                "order_id"
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "expireTime": "2026-11-03T06:00:00Z"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Cache created. `usageMetadata.totalTokenCount` is the cached token count used to calculate write and storage fees",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CachedContent"
                },
                "example": {
                  "name": "cachedContents/20261103012026348092000s1oTuB96",
                  "model": "models/gemini-3.8-flash",
                  "displayName": "product-manual-v3",
                  "createTime": "2026-11-03T01:20:27.311Z",
                  "updateTime": "2026-11-03T01:20:27.311Z",
                  "expireTime": "2026-11-03T02:20:26.902Z",
                  "usageMetadata": {
                    "totalTokenCount": 7525
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid parameters; model does not support explicit caching; unavailable for the current user group; content below the minimum cache token count",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 400,
                    "message": "ttl must not exceed 604800s (168h)",
                    "status": "INVALID_ARGUMENT",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "INVALID_ARGUMENT",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "API Key is invalid or missing",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 401,
                    "message": "Invalid API key",
                    "status": "UNAUTHENTICATED"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "Insufficient balance for cache write and storage fees",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 402,
                    "message": "insufficient quota for cache storage prepayment",
                    "status": "RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "The Key cannot access this model, the source IP is not on its allowlist, or the Key's user group is no longer available",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 403,
                    "message": "This key is not allowed to use model gemini-3.8-flash",
                    "status": "PERMISSION_DENIED"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Explicit caching is not enabled",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 404,
                    "message": "explicit context caching is not enabled",
                    "status": "NOT_FOUND",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "EXPLICIT_CACHE_DISABLED",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "Request body exceeds 10 MB",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 413,
                    "message": "cache content exceeds 10485760 bytes; reference large files with fileData.fileUri instead",
                    "status": "INVALID_ARGUMENT",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "CACHE_CONTENT_TOO_LARGE",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Rate limit exceeded",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 429,
                    "message": "Rate limit exceeded",
                    "status": "RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "Service temporarily unavailable. This request is not charged; please retry later",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 502,
                    "message": "the request could not be completed due to a service authorization problem; please retry later or contact support",
                    "status": "INTERNAL",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "UPSTREAM_ERROR",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Service temporarily unavailable; please retry later",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 503,
                    "message": "explicit context caching is temporarily unavailable",
                    "status": "UNAVAILABLE",
                    "details": [
                      {
                        "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo",
                        "reason": "INTERNAL",
                        "domain": "evolink.ai"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "get": {
        "summary": "List caches",
        "operationId": "geminiListCachedContents",
        "tags": [
          "Explicit Context Caching"
        ],
        "description": "List all **unexpired** caches for the current account (owned by account, regardless of Key), ordered by expiry time descending. Expired or deleted caches are excluded. Free of charge.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "pageSize",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Items per page. Default 50, maximum 200.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 50,
              "maximum": 200
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "pageToken",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "The `nextPageToken` from the previous response; omit for the first page.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Cache list. Includes `nextPageToken` when another page is available",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ListCachedContentsResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "cachedContents": [
                    {
                      "name": "cachedContents/20261103012026348092000s1oTuB96",
                      "model": "models/gemini-3.8-flash",
                      "displayName": "product-manual-v3",
                      "createTime": "2026-11-03T01:20:27.311Z",
                      "updateTime": "2026-11-03T01:20:27.311Z",
                      "expireTime": "2026-11-03T02:20:26.902Z",
                      "usageMetadata": {
                        "totalTokenCount": 7525
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "nextPageToken": "50"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid pageToken",
